ges, collage elements of aged paper, and watercolor washes. The color palette is muted and earthy, dominated by rust reds, deep ochres, aged paper browns, and dull metallic greys. The overall mood is one of quiet, surreal migration and lost history. No border and no artist signature should be on the image."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 523, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Prompt", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.5.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [711.0232543945312, 842.1714477539062], "pos": [37500, 3030], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 695, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "id": 559, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 32}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [937.04833984375, 622.4031372070312], "pos": [38240, 3180], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 694, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}], "flags": {}, "id": 558, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 34}, {"